te\": \"| C1 (G1 group only): 1 \u00b5F/6.3 V | C2 = 1 \u00b5F/6.3 V | Matches G1-specific value |\"}], \"impact\": \"A 1000 \u00b5F bulk capacitor in place of 1 \u00b5F changes the display power-rail filtering and the start-up/inrush behaviour of the boost converter, and may not fit the footprint intended for a 1 \u00b5F part.\", \"confidence\": 0.45}]}",
